      "id": 148987,
      "name": "Eric R",
      "username": "Eric_R",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-15T22:49:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><strong>Update:</strong> the final rules will almost certainly change this answer to \"add the new Fear Card to the bottom of the stack of cards you're resolving this Invader Phase\".</p><p>(While writing the FAQ for this question, I realized that \"delay it by a turn\" was... not <em>inconsistent</em>, but slightly&nbsp;<em>incoherent</em> with Terror Level increases applying immediately. Also, there's an argument to be made for rarely-relevant edge cases with minimal play impact to err on the side of permissiveness.)</p><p>It really doesn't come up very often, though, so it's not much of a change.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:27:21.835Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 19,
